'''Nurse Cat''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 2.9.1 Update|Version 2.9.1]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during [[THE DYNAMITES (Gacha Event)|THE DYNAMITES]] and [[AIR BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|AIR BUSTERS]] events. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 6.7 Update|Version 6.7]] increases attack damage, health, range and movement speed. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 9.8 Update|Version 9.8]], and Ultra Talents were added in [[Version 13.1 Update|Version 13.1]].

