==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Nurse Cat was a part of two other [[Cat Combo]]s: [[Five Hearts (Removed Combo)|Five Hearts]] and [[Showing Leg (Removed Combo)|Showing Leg]].
*Nurse Cat and [[Master of Mind Soractes (Special Cat)|Master of Mind Soractes]] are the first units to gain the [[Sage Slayer]] ability.
*Nurse Cat was the winner of the [[PONOS Campaigns/The Great Nyanko Tournament|Great Nyanko Tournament]] held by [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]] to see which Uber Rare was the players' favorite.
*Joyful Nurse Cat may reference Nurse Joy from the [[wikipedia:Pokémon (video game series)|Pokémon]] series, with similar color patterns and name.

